Subject: [PATCH v14 2/5] ring-buffer: Skip invalid sub-buffers when validating persistent ring buffer
Date: Mon, 30 Mar 2026 21:50:04 +0900
Message-ID:  <177487500432.3463592.13753720277119177967.stgit@mhiramat.tok.corp.google.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.53.0.1018.g2bb0e51243-goog
